feature: market-data-backend
description: |
  Implement the Market Data backend module — the data spine of the platform.
  Covers the first 7 tasks from Hoang_planning_implemention.md:
  (1) create 4 missing skeleton dirs, (2) run Prisma migrations + wire PrismaService,
  (3) BinanceAdapter.fetchKlines + MarketDataService.getCandles/getCandlesRange with caching,
  (4) BinanceAdapter WebSocket stream + bounded auto-reconnect (ADR-0007),
  (5) MarketDataGateway WebSocket relay (market-data:candles + market-data:status),
  (6) REST endpoints + subscribe/unsubscribe with subscription dedup,
  (7) publish MarketDataUpdated event on IEventBus.
  Frontend chart components (tasks 8-13) are OUT OF SCOPE.
created: 2026-08-09
status: specified
owner: Hoang
phases:
  - specify: complete
  - plan: complete
  - tasks: complete
  - implement: pending   # user will switch model before implementing
  - analyze: pending
  - converge: pending
kb_snapshot:
  constitution_loaded: true
  architecture_loaded: true
  modules_affected:
    - Market Data (primary owner: Hoang)
    - Shared infrastructure (owner: Hoang)
    - Database / Prisma (owner: Hoang)
  related_adrs:
    - ADR-0002 (Modular Monolith)
    - ADR-0004 (Adapter Pattern for Data Sources)
    - ADR-0005 (Event-Driven Communication — MarketDataUpdated)
    - ADR-0007 (Auto-Reconnect for External APIs)
  contracts_loaded:
    - kb/contracts/market-data.yaml (SSoT for entities, interfaces, endpoints, WS channels)
    - kb/contracts/events.yaml (IEventBus, MarketDataUpdated payload, EventEnvelope)
